Tenant-specific Alembic migrations.

Generate a manual migration:
- `uv run alembic -c alembic_tenants.ini revision -m "message"`

Upgrade all tenant databases from the shared `tenants` table:
- `uv run alembic -c alembic_tenants.ini upgrade head`

Upgrade one tenant database directly:
- `uv run alembic -c alembic_tenants.ini -x tenant_db=tenant_example upgrade head`
